WEBVTT

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.518
ADAMAS

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:05.959
GRACE ABOUNDING

00:02:07.085 --> 00:02:08.711
Such intense pressure!

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:10.839
What's with his form?

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:15.677
Even at his best, Zeus would only last
12 or 13 minutes like that.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.221
After the damage he's taken,
he'll barely last five.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.348
Geez, gramps.

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:22.976
Don't go destroying heaven.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.230
With his muscles compressed
to their very limit,

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.859
they creaked with the immense energy
bound inside them.

00:02:31.442 --> 00:02:34.863
Since they seemed to threaten
to let loose a malevolent beast,

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:39.617
Adam unconsciously raised his guard
for the first time in the fight.

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:51.212
Zeus' final form, Adamas!

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:56.050
His secret technique was
nothing more than the collection of energy

00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:59.637
by compressing his muscles
and releasing it in his fist

00:02:59.721 --> 00:03:01.556
with every ounce of speed,

00:03:01.639 --> 00:03:04.809
making it the most powerful punch ever!

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:07.478
God's True Right!

00:03:07.562 --> 00:03:08.521
GOD'S TRUE RIGHT
DIVINE REFLECTION

00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:11.816
Unbelievable!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.486
Adam has copied
even Zeus' mighty straight right!

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:20.199
God's True Left!

00:03:20.283 --> 00:03:23.328
But Zeus doesn't flinch!

00:03:26.497 --> 00:03:28.791
And Adam counters!

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:32.337
Zeus throws another right!

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.047
DIVINE REFLECTION

00:03:42.096 --> 00:03:43.973
He keeps throwing punches!

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.808
Even though every punch is countered,

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:48.394
Zeus keeps on throwing them
as if he's possessed!

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:54.776
Incredible! But no matter
how hard he tries, it's useless!

00:03:54.859 --> 00:03:59.239
Adam's Divine Reflection reads
everything Zeus throws at him!

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.324
Adam's winning!

00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:06.496
-This is bad!
-What?

00:04:13.378 --> 00:04:14.963
What's this?

00:04:15.046 --> 00:04:19.550
Though Adam has been dodging
all the punches, he's suddenly bleeding!

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:21.552
What's going on?

00:04:21.636 --> 00:04:22.470
Damn!

00:04:24.555 --> 00:04:27.058
More than likely, he's overheating!

00:04:28.309 --> 00:04:31.271
Until now, Zeus has been so reckless,

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:33.940
throwing punches so carelessly,
that I hadn't noticed!

00:04:34.524 --> 00:04:39.195
Each of his punches would normally be
inescapable killer moves!

00:04:41.197 --> 00:04:42.448
His body is shrieking!

00:04:42.532 --> 00:04:47.370
In this fight, Adam has used
Divine Reflection without ceasing!

00:04:48.079 --> 00:04:49.914
Continuously mimicking Zeus' moves

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:53.001
is putting an unimaginable burden
on his nervous system!

00:04:53.918 --> 00:04:58.381
You mean, if this fight continues,
Adam will break?

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:03.428
I never thought he'd bulldoze
Adam's Divine Reflection like that!

00:05:03.511 --> 00:05:06.931
Does that gorilla geezer bastard
even know what he's doing?

00:05:07.515 --> 00:05:09.058
-Overheat?
-Overheat?

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:12.186
That's right. He's almost at his limit.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.982
Then, at this rate,
Zeus will win for sure!

00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:19.736
All right! Time to wipe
the smirk off that faker's face!

00:05:23.197 --> 00:05:24.907
Don't go jumping to conclusions.

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.617
See?

00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:33.958
Zeus!

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:36.919
His muscles look like
they'll tear apart even now!

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:40.173
He can't keep up
that volley of blows forever.

00:05:40.256 --> 00:05:45.011
Gramps' body has reached its limit.
He's on the verge of overheating.

00:05:45.595 --> 00:05:49.640
It's the first time I've seen Zeus
fight so desperately. How adorable!

00:05:52.894 --> 00:05:56.230
If I were to compare it to something,

00:05:57.273 --> 00:06:01.277
it's a battle of stamina
to see which glass…

00:06:06.407 --> 00:06:08.993
will overflow with their lifeblood first.

00:06:22.048 --> 00:06:23.216
That was close.

00:06:23.299 --> 00:06:26.594
They're both barely keeping
a hold of the surface tension.

00:06:27.178 --> 00:06:29.889
Even just the slightest trigger

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.434
will cause the glass to overflow.

00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:38.731
It was only a matter of time
until that happened.

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.569
DIVINE AXE

00:06:51.035 --> 00:06:55.039
But for every killer technique
that Zeus threw at him…

00:07:03.631 --> 00:07:05.341
METEOR JAB

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.802
…Adam held his ground
and used his Divine Reflection

00:07:07.885 --> 00:07:10.263
to throw them all right back!

00:07:10.888 --> 00:07:14.058
Geez. Looks like
neither of them is giving an inch.

00:07:15.226 --> 00:07:18.229
It was a storm of blows
that their lives depended on!

00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:20.648
With the ultimate at stake,

00:07:20.731 --> 00:07:22.733
the fight was so beautiful,

00:07:22.817 --> 00:07:24.026
and before they knew it,

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:28.030
both gods and humans
found themselves on their feet.

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:31.784
-Hermes.
-Yes, Ares.

00:07:32.368 --> 00:07:36.289
I never thought
a fight could be so beautiful.

00:07:36.372 --> 00:07:38.791
Indeed. So it is.

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.544
Brünnhilde…

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:45.465
I can't seem to stop my tears.

00:07:47.508 --> 00:07:48.843
Adam…

00:07:52.513 --> 00:07:53.681
Hey, Adam!

00:07:53.764 --> 00:07:56.934
Your punches haven't even
left a scratch on Zeus!

00:07:57.518 --> 00:08:00.021
Hurry up and go down, Zeus!

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.566
Gramps!

00:08:03.649 --> 00:08:07.320
You better not give up, no matter what!

00:08:19.123 --> 00:08:22.376
Hang in there, darling!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.880
Please, Zeus! Let Daddy win!

00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:31.385
Go down!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.557
Hurry up and go down! End this!

00:08:38.309 --> 00:08:41.729
While Valhalla Arena went wild
with feverish excitement,

00:08:41.812 --> 00:08:44.148
the first one to realize

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:47.318
what was about to happen
was none other than Adam himself.

00:08:48.528 --> 00:08:52.365
Everything that happens in this world
is caused by things

00:08:52.448 --> 00:08:55.326
far more insignificant
than we can imagine.

00:08:56.285 --> 00:08:58.287
Even devastating storms

00:08:59.664 --> 00:09:04.335
are set off by the tiniest of triggers.

00:09:35.283 --> 00:09:37.660
That's a clean hit!

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:41.247
At last, Zeus has landed a blow on Adam!

00:09:43.249 --> 00:09:45.585
Adam's taken another one!

00:09:45.668 --> 00:09:47.378
And now Zeus is

00:09:48.045 --> 00:09:51.674
throwing a series of blows,
a raging storm of blows!

00:09:51.757 --> 00:09:53.175
Adam is on the defensive!

00:09:53.259 --> 00:09:56.053
He's become a punching bag!

00:09:56.137 --> 00:09:59.890
Brünnhilde, Adam is…

00:10:00.474 --> 00:10:03.394
He's putting everything
into defending himself.

00:10:03.978 --> 00:10:05.813
Most likely, Adam's eyes are…

00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:08.691
completely blind.

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:14.822
It seems Adam overflowed first.

00:10:16.407 --> 00:10:18.326
Now it's over for sure.

00:10:18.409 --> 00:10:20.369
Yes, it's over.

00:10:20.453 --> 00:10:23.789
But that guy Adam,

00:10:23.873 --> 00:10:25.875
he was pretty incredible.

00:10:27.376 --> 00:10:29.629
But I'm not complimenting him!

00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:31.422
DIVINE AXE

00:10:33.883 --> 00:10:36.052
He's through…

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:43.184
Darling! Please stop!

00:10:43.267 --> 00:10:45.519
You've done enough, Dad!

00:10:45.603 --> 00:10:47.647
Just go down!

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.607
Damn it all!

00:10:51.525 --> 00:10:55.946
Quit fighting, Dad! Give up, damn you!

00:10:58.366 --> 00:11:02.036
-Stop!
-We know who the winner is!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.790
-Someone stop this!
-Please stop!

00:11:07.667 --> 00:11:10.294
While all of humanity fell into despair,

00:11:10.378 --> 00:11:12.672
from his darkness, Adam…

00:11:18.636 --> 00:11:21.055
Somewhere, there's a baby crying.

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:25.601
It's all right. Don't cry.

00:11:27.144 --> 00:11:29.313
Your father will protect you

00:11:29.897 --> 00:11:32.233
from all the bad and scary things.

00:11:42.243 --> 00:11:46.163
TO THE VERY END,
FATHER WAS DETERMINED TO WIN.

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:50.709
Bastard!

00:11:52.294 --> 00:11:53.712
I got you.

00:11:57.049 --> 00:12:00.136
He took those blows on purpose
so he could grab him!

00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:02.012
That's insane!

00:12:46.432 --> 00:12:50.436
It seemed as if
the shower of blows would never end.

00:12:55.357 --> 00:12:56.984
But finally…

00:12:57.067 --> 00:12:59.236
IT SUDDENLY HAPPENED

00:13:06.494 --> 00:13:09.205
Zeus…

00:13:09.288 --> 00:13:12.583
has crumpled to his knees!

00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:25.554
Gramps!

00:13:29.141 --> 00:13:31.435
That's not possible!

00:13:32.019 --> 00:13:33.020
Zeus!

00:13:36.815 --> 00:13:38.567
It's over.

00:13:42.029 --> 00:13:44.782
Yes! You did it, Dad!

00:13:44.865 --> 00:13:47.243
-Yay!
-Darling!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.762
He's dead…

00:14:06.845 --> 00:14:08.681
Adam is already…

00:14:09.515 --> 00:14:11.767
dead!

00:14:13.477 --> 00:14:15.896
Took you long enough to notice.

00:14:16.897 --> 00:14:20.317
Long before I collapsed…

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:25.906
this guy had taken his last breath.

00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:31.203
Even so, he never surrendered.

00:14:31.787 --> 00:14:36.709
In fact, even after he died,

00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:41.213
he continued throwing punches.

00:14:53.976 --> 00:14:55.561
Hey, kid.

00:14:55.644 --> 00:14:58.981
You put this geezer on his ass.

00:14:59.565 --> 00:15:02.985
Damn. You're one hell of a man.

00:15:09.491 --> 00:15:13.412
If this had been a contest of endurance,

00:15:13.996 --> 00:15:15.831
you would have won.

00:15:31.305 --> 00:15:35.893
In the second bout of the final battle
between god and man, Ragnarok,

00:15:35.976 --> 00:15:39.313
Zeus is the victor!

00:15:39.813 --> 00:15:43.984
Having lost two straight bouts,
the situation for humanity was desperate.

00:15:44.068 --> 00:15:46.070
Yet all of humanity…

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:51.033
stood tall!

00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:53.535
Though their father, Adam, had died,

00:15:53.619 --> 00:15:56.872
he left a great inheritance
for his children.

00:15:57.706 --> 00:16:03.545
The power to rebel against the gods
and the unprecedented confidence to do so!

00:16:04.922 --> 00:16:07.549
ZEUS VS. ADAM
TIME: 7 MINUTES, 13 SECONDS

00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:09.843
WINNING ATTACK: FISTS
WINNER: ZEUS

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.436
What's the meaning of this, Brünnhilde?

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.854
Brünnhilde!

00:16:20.938 --> 00:16:23.691
Göll. Calm down.

00:16:25.734 --> 00:16:27.403
Hrist…

00:16:27.486 --> 00:16:29.905
You saw it too, didn't you, Hrist?

00:16:29.989 --> 00:16:32.241
The knuckleduster was untouched!

00:16:32.324 --> 00:16:33.158
HRIST, SECOND OF THE 13 VALKYRIE

00:16:33.742 --> 00:16:37.538
Then why did Reginleif have to die?

00:16:39.039 --> 00:16:40.124
Göll,

00:16:40.207 --> 00:16:43.544
as the name suggests,
Völundr is a technique

00:16:43.627 --> 00:16:46.255
in which man and Valkyrie become one.

00:16:47.548 --> 00:16:50.384
We do not simply transform
our body into a weapon.

00:16:50.467 --> 00:16:52.052
In other words,

00:16:52.636 --> 00:16:54.138
we share the same fate.

00:16:54.805 --> 00:16:57.057
We fight together, and…

00:16:57.641 --> 00:16:59.810
we die together.

00:17:10.154 --> 00:17:12.156
There's no need to cry.

00:17:12.239 --> 00:17:16.577
Reginleif was well aware
of what kind of battle this was.

00:17:17.077 --> 00:17:18.412
Listen.

00:17:18.495 --> 00:17:20.831
When this time comes for you,

00:17:20.914 --> 00:17:23.792
learn from Reginleif
and prepare yourself for your fate.

00:17:24.293 --> 00:17:27.046
I couldn't even tell her goodbye.

00:17:27.129 --> 00:17:29.590
I couldn't do anything for her!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.926
-Göll…
-Hrist…

00:17:34.053 --> 00:17:35.596
That hurts!

00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:38.557
That hurts, Hrist…

00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:43.479
Those fucking bastard gods!

00:17:44.063 --> 00:17:47.983
I swear I'll make them pay for this!

00:17:48.609 --> 00:17:50.611
I forgot!

00:17:50.694 --> 00:17:54.281
Hrist is the only Valkyrie
who has two powers

00:17:54.364 --> 00:17:56.658
that dwell within her one body!

00:17:56.742 --> 00:17:58.077
Her name, Hrist,

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:03.665
means "the one who trembles
with fear and with rage."

00:18:04.833 --> 00:18:08.337
Please calm down, Hrist!

00:18:16.845 --> 00:18:19.014
That fucking geezer!

00:18:19.098 --> 00:18:21.517
How dare he trash my trump card like that!

00:18:25.062 --> 00:18:26.105
There she goes!

00:18:26.188 --> 00:18:28.690
She's binge eating those
special salmiak licorice pies!

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:33.028
She always does this
when she's totally stressed out!

00:18:33.112 --> 00:18:36.281
If we lose the next one,
that's three in a row.

00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:40.369
We have to do
whatever it takes to win the next one!

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:49.753
Brünnhilde?

00:18:50.254 --> 00:18:51.505
What's wrong?

00:18:54.258 --> 00:18:55.092
THE THIRD BOUT'S COMBATANT
FOR THE GODS IS POSEIDON

00:18:55.175 --> 00:18:56.176
-Poseidon?
-Poseidon?

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:59.429
They're not letting up at all.

00:18:59.513 --> 00:19:01.849
What? Poseidon?

00:19:01.932 --> 00:19:06.728
It's only the third bout!
Why do they keep sending out their best?

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:11.984
Poseidon is Zeus' older brother, you know!

00:19:12.067 --> 00:19:14.987
He must be totally brutal!
Of all the gods!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.406
Brünnhilde, is it going to be all right?

00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:22.911
I think the gods want to
end this with seven straight wins!

00:19:22.995 --> 00:19:23.996
Göll.

00:19:24.913 --> 00:19:29.001
Would you mind
keeping your mouth shut, please?

00:19:30.002 --> 00:19:34.298
If you don't,
I just might have to remove your head.

00:19:37.134 --> 00:19:40.596
She sure says the most frightening things
in the gentlest of ways!

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.892
Not even the schizoid Hrist
can hold a candle to that!

00:19:49.062 --> 00:19:52.482
Unfortunately,
we're already in a tight corner.

00:19:53.942 --> 00:19:54.776
Who…

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.862
who can handle this?

00:19:57.863 --> 00:20:02.701
Who can possibly face
the Zeus of the sea, Poseidon?

00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:12.127
When did he show up?

00:20:13.128 --> 00:20:14.671
I will go.

00:20:22.638 --> 00:20:23.472
Who are you?

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:31.480
Wait! Are you Kojiro Sasaki?

00:20:31.563 --> 00:20:33.732
You look totally different.

00:20:33.815 --> 00:20:38.111
You look kind of old.
In fact, you're a total geezer!

00:20:38.695 --> 00:20:39.947
What's going on here?

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:43.951
I thought that the souls summoned
to Ragnarok take their strongest form,

00:20:44.034 --> 00:20:48.622
their form during their peak,
regardless of their age at death.

00:20:48.705 --> 00:20:52.251
That's exactly right. So how come you're…

00:21:01.718 --> 00:21:03.512
Got you.

00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:10.811
Is this cow's milk? That was good.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.358
This is pretty good!

00:21:16.441 --> 00:21:18.527
I'm not sure what it is, but it's great!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:21.029
Delicious! This is great!

00:21:21.113 --> 00:21:22.823
He's eating that stuff?

00:21:22.906 --> 00:21:26.493
There's no way this guy is Kojiro!

00:21:27.786 --> 00:21:29.621
That was quite a feast.

00:21:30.205 --> 00:21:32.040
Indeed, he isn't what I expected.

00:21:32.791 --> 00:21:33.875
However,

00:21:34.459 --> 00:21:37.879
the way he moved just now,
that's the move of a confident master.

00:21:38.797 --> 00:21:41.091
No doubt about it. He's the real thing!

00:21:43.427 --> 00:21:47.264
It has been over 400 years
since I passed on.

00:21:47.347 --> 00:21:51.101
During that time, I have never ceased
honing my swordsmanship.

00:21:51.685 --> 00:21:55.105
My Ganryu's evolution has not yet ended.

00:21:57.649 --> 00:22:02.070
In other words,
this is the golden age of Kojiro!

00:23:29.866 --> 00:23:34.871
Subtitle translation by: Brian Athey
